  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Most men spend their entire lives either trying to become their father or trying not to.\n\nA father\u2019s impact is there, whether good or bad.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2038803052811964833",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T02:18:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "No amount of money will make the wrong people happy.  \n\nYou can NEVER win over the wrong people.\n\n\nNew York Post (@nypost)\n\nFive Guys CEO says he gave $1.5M staff bonus so he wouldn't get shot in the back like UnitedHealthcare boss trib.al/zBJx4eJ\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/nypost/status/2038374061487595908#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2038645076927103423",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T15:50:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Anyone can be act like a good father in public.\n\nThe real test is how you treat your kids when nobody\u2019s watching.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2037522023019352071",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-27T13:28:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Top 1% pays 42% of all federal income taxes.  \n\nBottom 50% pays 2.3%.\n\nAnd Congress continues to waste tax payers money.\n\n\nElizabeth Warren (@SenWarren)\n\nToday, I'm introducing my wealth tax \u2014 and more than 50 members of Congress are joining me.\n\nIt\u2019s time for the government to start working for American families, not just the ultra-rich.\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/SenWarren/status/2037226619371135226#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2037354770420122095",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-27T02:23:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Hard work has a funny way of paying off quietly.\n\nOne day a door opens and everyone thinks it happened overnight.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2037186310767550758",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-26T15:14:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Nick Shirley is the kind of young man we need more of.\n\nHe\u2019s Tough\nHe\u2019s Relentless\nHe confronts respectfully\nHe\u2019s Fearless \nHe\u2019s Brave\nHe Loves America\nHe\u2019s a Man of faith\nHe\u2019s Humble yet driven.\n\nWe need to continue to encourage &amp; support young brave men like him.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036991251351036074",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-26T02:18:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "God loves farmers.  \n\nThere\u2019s something very special about farmers.  \n\nI have tremendous respect for anyone who\u2019s in the business. \ud83e\udee1 \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036891699880890878",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-25T19:43:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The $3.5 trillion choke point China fears more than the Strait of Hormuz.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036495010024087741",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T17:27:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Your zip code will determine your net worth.\n\nIf 4 athletes got a $200M contract.\nSame money. \nDifferent states.\n\nDodgers: $26.6M in taxes\nYankees: $25.5M\nCowboys/Heat: $0\n\nInvest that $26M for 40 years:\n\n4% \u2192 $125M\n8% \u2192 $550M\n11.5% \u2192 $2B\n\nGenerational wealth for:\nkids &gt; state\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036451552802574714",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T14:34:20+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The loudest applause rarely builds the biggest businesses.\n\nVision does.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036435866240032808",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T13:32:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Kentucky family turns down a $26M offer to their farm into a data center. \n\nThe offer is roughly 10X the rate for farmland in the area.\n\nMajor respect! \n\n\u201cAgriculture is the most healthful, most useful &amp; most noble employment of man.\u201d George Washington\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036412420323697151",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T11:58:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Success has a simple formula:\n\nShow up when it\u2019s easy.\nShow up when it\u2019s hard.\nAnd keep showing up when everyone else disappears.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036249135280505220",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-24T01:10:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Life changes when you realize this: you\u2019ll never get the same moment twice. \n\nUse it wisely.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2036090339753099531",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-23T14:39:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Stop reliving yesterday\u2019s mistakes. Focus on winning today.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035770986465722439",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T17:30:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Life will force you to reset at times.  \n\nThat\u2019s fine. Just make sure quitting is never an option.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035726190162686444",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T14:32:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The biggest advantage a boy can have isn\u2019t money, a high IQ or connections.  \n\nIt\u2019s having a present, strong father.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035540182275862705",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T02:12:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "None of this social media stuff matters if you\u2019re not happy in your actual life.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035468240009167296",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-21T21:27:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you\u2019re good enough, you\u2019re old enough.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035373669678026918",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-21T15:11:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "patrick-bet-david",
      "voiceName": "Patrick Bet-David",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Build a life you enjoy when the cameras and phones are off.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/patrickbetdavid/status/2035005692197687648",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T14:49:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
